Rule 1 (padding must be a non-negative integer or a tuple of two non-negative integers)
{v_1 : int ⊎ tuple(int)} |= (v_1 ≥ 0) ∨ (v_1.len = 2 ∧ v_1[0] ≥ 0 ∧ v_1[1] ≥ 0)
